{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And they heard, etc., לְרוּחַ הַיּוֹם (toward the breeze of the day).</b> The reason Scripture informed us of the order of His movement is to say that by this they knew to examine the place where they would hide themselves from Him, and that is its saying <b>מִתְהַלֵּךְ לְרוּחַ הַיּוֹם</b> — meaning, toward the western side of the Garden, whereas they stood in the middle of the Garden."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:38:40.321968197Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}